OL,3,AMajor tech stocks plunge as US midterms
OL,4,Aadd to fears of AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of billions of dollars in
OL,7,Fmarket value has been wiped from major
OL,8,Ftech firms in a stock market rout after
OL,9,Fthe US midterm elections sparked
OL,10,Fconcerns of a slowdown in AI
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
OL,13,FFollowing Democratic wins after
OL,14,Felection campaigns run on slowing AI,
OL,15,Fshares in firms across the tech and
OL,16,Fartificial intelligence sectors
OL,17,Fplummeted.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
