OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AMajor tech stocks plunge as US midterms
OL,4,Aadd to fears of AI slowdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq composite stock
OL,7,Findex closed down by more than 5.5% to
OL,8,Flose an estimated $2.5tn in market
OL,9,Fcapitalisation, according to Dow Jones
OL,10,Fdata, while other key US stock indexes
OL,11,Falso saw big losses in their worst days
OL,12,Fsince 2025.
OL,14,FThe sell-off comes on top of broader
OL,15,Fconcerns about whether the huge amounts
OL,16,Fbeing spent on AI will pay off.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
