OL,3,AMarried at First Sight UK cancelled
OL,4,Aafter BBC revealed rape allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarried at First Sight UK will not
OL,7,Freturn, Channel 4 has said, following a
OL,8,FBBC investigation into the hit reality
OL,9,FTV show.
OL,11,FThe Channel 4 show was plunged into
OL,12,Fcrisis earlier this year, after
OL,13,FPanorama revealed rape allegations from
OL,14,Ftwo female cast members on the show,
OL,15,Fwhile a third woman alleged a
OL,16,Fnon-consensual sex act. The men
OL,17,Finvolved have denied all the
OL,18,Fallegations against them.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
