OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMarried at First Sight UK cancelled
OL,4,Aafter BBC revealed rape allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review was commissioned by Channel 4
OL,7,Fshortly after the BBC first contacted
OL,8,Fthe broadcaster, with details of the
OL,9,Fallegations we had heard.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, the completed review
OL,12,Frecommended extra safeguards on the
OL,13,Fshow. But Channel 4 said the programme
OL,14,Fhad "run its course" and apologised to
OL,15,Fthe women involved in the
OL,16,Finvestigation.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
