OL,3,AThe Russell Brand I saw in court was
OL,4,Anot the flamboyant character most
OL,5,Apeople will know
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a three-week trial, the
OL,8,F51-year-old was found guilty of one
OL,9,Fcharge of rape and three charges of
OL,10,Fsexual assault. He was found not guilty
OL,11,Fof two counts of rape and one count of
OL,12,Fattempted indecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
